WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:03.310
Evaluations and end of season

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:05.990
How are your players improving?

00:00:06.990 --> 00:00:14.130
After each game, evaluate your players: hitting, defence, and pitching if they pitched. A few seconds each.

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:19.780
The app uses it: it puts each player where they’re solid, and plays them where they’re learning.

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:29.120
Not ready to pitch or catch early in the season? To avoid. Ready to learn? To develop: they’ll get their innings.

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:32.850
Before a tournament, review their skills.

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:39.310
And at the end of the season, a report for each player, to hand to them: their strengths, their progress.

00:00:40.510 --> 00:00:44.720
BaseballLineup. Less paperwork, more baseball.
